   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi,</div><div><br></div><div><br></div>I&#39;m a newbie and I don&#39;t know if I&#39;m doing this right.<div><br></div><div>I&#39;m trying to run a ideal points model based on &quot;legislators&quot; by Simon Jackman. This model was originally written in WinBUGS and I&#39;m coding it in Stan. </div><div><br></div><div>Unfortunately, my algorithm has got stuck here for hours:</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\">&quot;<span style=\"font-size:8pt;line-height:13px;white-space:pre-wrap\">SAMPLING FOR MODEL &#39;5d63bb8f5de6f7104af8cc8a19924b0d&#39; NOW (CHAIN 1).</span></font></span></div><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:13px;font-size:8pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\">\r\nChain 1, Iteration:     1 / 12000 [  0%]  (Warmup)&quot;</font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:13px;font-size:8pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:13px;font-size:8pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:13px;font-size:8pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\">I don&#39;t know if it is normal or I&#39;m making a mistake with my model (posted below).</font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:13px;font-size:8pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:13px;font-size:8pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\">Could someone check it?</font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:13px;font-size:8pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:13px;font-size:8pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\">Guilherme</font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:13px;font-size:8pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:13px;font-size:8pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><font color=\"#000000\">PS: </font><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">I have seen there&#39;s another post about the same algorithm (&#39;legislators&#39;) here ( <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!msg/stan-users/OWyrW9176f8/Z_fY1t2WwM4J\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!msg/stan-users/OWyrW9176f8/Z_fY1t2WwM4J&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792463492792000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3jrvXVgLJEPiJJIQOR-rpF\">https://groups.google.com/forum/#!msg/stan-users/OWyrW9176f8/Z_fY1t2WwM4J</a> ) but I decided to start a new one because I thought my issues were specific.</span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:13px;font-size:8pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:13px;font-size:8pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:13px;font-size:8pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><font color=\"#000000\">The complete code: &lt; <a href=\"http://github.com/duarteguilherme/legislators-based/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://github.com/duarteguilherme/legislators-based/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792463492792000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2rVCClbfiltof8b-8ooiqJ\">http://github.com/duarteguilherme/legislators-based/</a> &gt;</font></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:13px;font-size:8pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:13px;font-size:8pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\">My model is this:</font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:13px;font-size:8pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:13px;font-size:8pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">&#39;data {\r\n  int&lt;lower=0&gt; N;\r\n  int&lt;lower=0&gt; L; // legisladores\r\n  int&lt;lower=0&gt; K; // rollcalls\r\n  int&lt;lower=0&gt; jj[N];\r\n  int&lt;lower=0&gt; kk[N];\r\n  int&lt;lower=0, upper=1&gt; y[N];\r\n}\r\nparameters {\r\n  real beta0[K];\r\n  real beta1[K];\r\n  real x[L];\r\n}\r\ntransformed parameters {\r\n}\r\n\r\nmodel {\r\nfor (i in 1:N){\r\n    y[i] ~ bernoulli(Phi_approx(x[jj[i]]*beta1[kk[i]] - beta0[kk[i]]));\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\nfor (i in 1:40){ x[i] ~ normal(0,1); }\r\n  for (i in 42:65){ x[i] ~ normal(0,1); }\r\n  for (i in 67:100){ x[i] ~ normal(0,1); }\r\n  beta1 ~ normal(0, 2);\r\n  beta0 ~ normal(0, 2);\r\n  x[41] ~ normal(-1, .0001);\r\n  x[66] ~ normal(1, .0001);\r\n}\r\n&#39;</pre><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:13px;font-size:8pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span>sessionInfo()\r\n</span>R version 3.2.2 (2015-08-14)\r\nPlatform: x86_64-pc-linux-gnu (64-bit)\r\nRunning under: Debian GNU/Linux 8 (jessie)\r\n\r\nlocale:\r\n [1] LC_CTYPE=pt_BR.UTF-8       LC_NUMERIC=C               LC_TIME=pt_BR.UTF-8       \r\n [4] LC_COLLATE=pt_BR.UTF-8     LC_MONETARY=pt_BR.UTF-8    LC_MESSAGES=pt_BR.UTF-8   \r\n [7] LC_PAPER=pt_BR.UTF-8       LC_NAME=C                  LC_ADDRESS=C              \r\n[10] LC_TELEPHONE=C             LC_MEASUREMENT=pt_BR.UTF-8 LC_IDENTIFICATION=C       \r\n\r\nattached base packages:\r\n[1] stats     graphics  grDevices utils     datasets  methods   base     \r\n\r\nloaded via a namespace (and not attached):\r\n[1] tools_3.2.2</font></span></pre></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
